cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Architectural Concept Design: an agent skill"
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skill for Claude Code, Codex and other compatible coding agents that turns a building
  brief into a checked concept design package. The agent writes one JSON design model; a bundled
  engine checks circulation, door swings, daylight, stairs, area limits and setbacks, then
  generates CAD floor plans, elevations and a section (DXF, PDF), a furnished interactive
  three.js model and an exact area schedule.
